 Yu. In his early years, he served as the Prefect of Luoyang. He later resigned his post and returned to his hometown, leveraging his family background to host guests and hold sway across the Jiang-Huai region, often accompanied by more than a hundred carriages whenever he traveled.","jp":"後漢末期の名門の出で、東呉の名将・周瑜の従兄。若くして洛陽令を務めた。後に官を辞して帰郷し、家族の威光を背景に好んで賓客を迎え、江淮の地に勢力を誇った。外出の際は、従える車列が常に百余乗にも及んだという。","kr":"동한 말기 명문가의 후손이자 동오의 명장 주유의 사촌 형이다. 일찍이 낙양령을 지냈으나, 훗날 관직을 사임하고 낙향하였다. 가문의 배경을 바탕으로 빈객을 환대하며 강회 일대에서 세력을 떨쳤고, 외출할 때마다 따르는 수레가 늘 백여 량에 달했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1045615","remark":"","surname":"周","surnameTc":"周","surnameEn":"Zhou","surnameJp":"周","surnameKr":"주","surnameOther":"","name":"晖","nameTc":"暉","nameEn":"Hui","nameJp":"暉","nameKr":"휘","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"周晖","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"0","city":"CS1028","gender":"0","rule":"45","force":"40","wise":"65","politics":"64","charm":"70","will":"61","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"21/20/17/24/19/65/22/19","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"2500","battleSoulPoint":"2500","debateSoulPoint":"2500","strategy":"1013915","strategy2":"1004401","professions":"0/0/0/1/0/0/2/3/3/0/3/1/2/3/0/0/2/3/0/1/0/0/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"0","loyalty":"100","reputation":"20000","evaluate":"5200","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"168","show":"184","death":"191","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":